From a7c6a317edef23c079a3c11d010b1e7c3ed3da39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ChenghaoLiu <linkmecry@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:14:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/11] [LoongArch] Add winecrt0, thread and exception support

Implement the remaining loongarch64 architecture branches:
- winecrt0/setjmp.c: __wine_setjmpex/__wine_longjmp for the jump buffer
- ntdll/loader.c: stub_entry_point trampoline for missing imports
- kernelbase/thread.c: switch_fiber and fiber context initialization
- msvcrt/ucrtbase: except_loongarch64.c with call_exc_handler helpers
- winnt.h: memory barriers, __fastfail, yield, 128-bit helpers, and
  DISPATCHER_CONTEXT_NONVOLREG_LOONGARCH64
- ntdll: current_machine, context tracing, actctx arch name, basic CPU info
---
